cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Fold in your work, please cite it as below. Please also cite UniProt, AlphaFold and 3Dmol.js."
title: "Fold: explore AlphaFold protein structures"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Fold is a static web app that searches UniProt for a protein and displays its
  AlphaFold-predicted 3D structure, coloured by per-residue confidence (pLDDT).
authors:
  - family-names: McDonald
    given-names: Aluinn
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-09"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/aluinn/biotech-project"
url: "https://biotech-project-six.vercel.app"
keywords:
  - AlphaFold
  - protein structure
  - UniProt
  - 3Dmol.js
  - visualization
